b8cf4ee7df0b11619fbfd.avif?t=1755589294\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Engaging Visual Storytelling:</u></strong>\u00a0A hand-dawn, vivid fantasy, full of adventures &amp; romance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Interactive Sex Scenes:</u></strong> Kiss, touch and caress your lovely boss wherever you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Affection System:</u></strong> Earn Mirika's trust and affection to unlock special moments together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dressing Room:</u></strong>\u00a0Choose clothes that Mirika can wear in sex scenes and romantic moments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Various Mini-Games:</u></strong> Dungeon navigation, material refinement, and a crafting system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197210/extras/1dcc943cd6e4173464166405b38a3287.avif?t=1755589294\" width=600 height=202 /></span></p>",
